29:["$","div","How RTO codes work",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"How RTO codes work"}],[["$","p","A standard registration number looks like MH12AB",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"A standard registration number looks like MH12AB1234. The first two letters stand for the state or union territory, the next two digits identify the RTO or district office within that state, followed by one to three letters for the series and a four-digit number. The RTO code usually maps to a city or district, such as 12 for Pune in Maharashtra."}],["$","p","New offices are created from time to time, so th",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"New offices are created from time to time, so the list of codes grows. That is why different cities in the same state can have codes that look sequential but are not always geographically close."}]],null,null]}]
2a:["$","div","What you can do at an RTO",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"What you can do at an RTO"}],[["$","p","RTOs handle new vehicle registration, renewal of",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"RTOs handle new vehicle registration, renewal of registration, transfer of ownership, driving licences, fitness certificates, permits and No Objection Certificates. Many of these services have moved online on the Parivahan portal, so check whether you can complete the task without a visit."}],["$","p","When you move to another state you must re-regis",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"When you move to another state you must re-register your vehicle with the new state’s RTO within the time the law allows, usually through an NOC from the original office."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Keep original documents ready, including RC, insurance and PUC",{"children":"Keep original documents ready, including RC, insurance and PUC"}],["$","li","Book appointments online where the state supports it",{"children":"Book appointments online where the state supports it"}],["$","li","Use only government portals for fees; avoid unofficial agents asking for extra money",{"children":"Use only government portals for fees; avoid unofficial agents asking for extra money"}]]}],null]}]
2b:["$","div","BH series and special plates",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"BH series and special plates"}],[["$","p","The Bharat (BH) series lets people who move freq",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"The Bharat (BH) series lets people who move frequently between states, such as defence personnel and some private-sector employees, keep one registration number across India. BH plates do not follow the state-and-RTO format and instead use a year, BH, a number and letters."}]],null,null]}]
